---
layout: page.njk
title: Gallery
subtitle: Moments from our community programs and events.
---

<div class="banner info"><span>💡</span><span>Click any photo to view it full-size.</span></div>

<div class="gallery-grid">
  {% for image in gallery %}
  <figure class="gallery-item" data-lightbox="{{ image.src }}">
    <img src="{{ image.src }}" alt="{{ image.caption }}" loading="lazy">
    <figcaption>{{ image.caption }}</figcaption>
  </figure>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<figure class="lightbox" id="lightbox" aria-hidden="true">
  <button class="lightbox-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
  <div>
    <img src="" alt="">
    <figcaption></figcaption>
  </div>
</figure>